Summon a Minotaur for [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns to attack your foes. Minotaurs cannot stay summoned for long, but they deal high damage.

It will get [69, 120, 165, 206, 245 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Strength, [12, 14, 16, 18, 20 (TL1-5)] Constitution and [48, 92, 130, 166, 200 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Dexterity.

Your summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%, resistance penetration %, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.

The minotaur's Strength and Dexterity will increase with your Mindpower.
